// Ported from MidLevelIrLoweringTests.SwitchPatternLowerer.NestedAggregateSwitchPatternBindsScalarLeavesAfterPatternSelection.
// PORT-NOTE: the C# original asserts direct codegen, locals "right"/"tail",
// ExtractField rvalues for "Values"/"Tail"/"Left"/"Right", and a switch_agg_match
// block binding both "right" and "tail" (and no leaf binding in switch_agg_test
